|---|---:|---|
| **Total Transcript Log Entries** | ${rawEntries.length} steps | Complete Trajectory |
| **Total User Turns / Interactions** | ${turnCount} turns | 100% Captured |
| **Workflow Stages Completed** | Stage 0 – Stage 8 | 100% Compliant |
